raph: 上下文预算、令牌消耗和成本汇总放在一起看。\n  - text: 系统状态\n  - paragraph: 自进化、诊断和后台状态统一收口。\n  - tablist:\n    - tab \"总览\":\n      - text: 总览\n    - tab \"事件流\":\n      - text: 事件流\n    - tab \"资源与成本\":\n      - text: 资源与成本\n    - tab \"系统\" [selected]:\n      - text: 系统\n  - tabpanel \"系统\":\n    - generic: 系统\n    - heading \"把后台状态和自进化收口\" [level=2]\n    - paragraph: 诊断不再单独占一个孤岛标签，而是和自进化一起作为系统视图。\n    - text: 外部动作回执\n    - paragraph: 识别重复执行、节点接管和必须人工核对的外部副作用。\n    - generic: 无待核对项\n    - button \"刷新外部动作回执\":\n    - generic: 后端 · disabled\n    - generic: 本机协调\n    - generic: 已提交 · 0\n    - generic: 执行中 · 0\n    - generic: 需要跨租户管理员权限。\n    - alert:\n      - generic: 需要跨租户管理员权限。\n      - generic: 需要跨租户管理员权限。\n    - heading \"诊断\" [level=1]\n    - paragraph: 集中查看和调试功能开关、后续建议、远程后端和不变量。\n    - tablist:\n      - tab \"运行态\"\n      - tab \"流式\"\n      - tab \"功能开关\" [active] [selected]\n      - tab \"建议\"\n      - tab \"远程\"\n      - tab \"不变量\"\n    - tabpanel \"功能开关\":\n      - generic: 功能开关\n      - button \"从磁盘重新加载功能开关\": 重新加载\n      - list:\n        - code: camouflage.enabled\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: LLM-driven prompt optimizer loop (A/B variants + pareto retirement).\n        - code: camouflage.interval_sec\n        - generic: \"600\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Tick interval for the camouflage scheduler.\n        - code: evolution.auto_trigger\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Enable automatic evolution trigger when fitness drops below threshold\n        - code: evolution.dual_helix_shadow_auto\n        - generic: \"false\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Allow risk-gated automatic shadow review for validated candidates, repeated failures, high risk, or low confidence. Never runs every task twice; keep off unless an operator enables staged sampling.\n        - code: execution.codex_app_server\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Use the isolated Codex App Server backend for a selected local Codex coding partner. Production-like deployments additionally require an explicit non-default enablement and a hard sandbox.\n        - code: regeneration.enabled\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Background self-repair scheduler (GEPA variants + rollback).\n        - code: regeneration.gepa_auto_apply\n        - generic: \"false\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Automatically apply GEPA-proposed prompt variants without human review.\n        - code: regeneration.interval_sec\n        - generic: \"600\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Tick interval for the regeneration scheduler.\n        - code: safety.invariants_enabled\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Enforce the 34-rule constitution during execution. Disable only for debugging.\n        - code: sessions.dated_layout\n        - generic: \"false\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Shard per-thread jsonl files under <agent>/sessions/<YYYY>/<MM>/. Off keeps the flat layout.\n        - code: sessions.index_enabled\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - paragraph: Maintain session_index.jsonl for fast thread listing.\n        - code: ui.ambient_suggestions\n        - generic: \"true\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Surface AI-generated follow-up tasks based on recent conversations. Experimental; enabled by default. Degrades to an empty bucket until scored turn history exists.\n        - code: ui.ambient_suggestions_interval_sec\n        - generic: \"21600\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Tick interval (seconds) for the ambient-suggestions background scheduler. Defaults to 6 hours.\n        - code: ui.prompts_hot_reload\n        - generic: \"false\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Pick up prompt template edits without a restart. Pre-req for A/B-testing personalities.\n        - code: ui.remote_transport\n        - generic: \"false\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: Expose SSH/WebSocket transport so a local desktop can connect to a remote octopus-agent runtime.\n        - code: ui.remote_workspace\n        - generic: \"false\"\n        - generic: default\n        - generic: 实验性\n        - paragraph: \"EXPERIMENTAL (default off, requires staged rollout before enabling): expose the Workspace HTTP API (mount + membership + file lease endpoints under /api/workspaces). While off, all /api/workspaces endpoints return 403 and frontend workspace entry points such as WorkspaceSwitcher are hidden.\"\n- region \"Notifications alt+T\""